From bc159fdb47fdd338f33c0f51fd56443b016f5126 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <173511395+At30c@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:05:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Fall back to inert BPF maps on legacy kernels

Redirect every BpfNetMaps BPF-map open failure in the current connectivity
service to an inert IBpfMap implementation. This keeps unsupported Linux
4.19 kernels from turning optional map failures into SystemServer crashes.

---
